  "initiate": {
   "title": "Initiate Faen's Notes",
   "author": "Faen",
   "pages": [
    "First rule: never step through a door you have not already stepped through. Second rule: you will, and the door will not mind.\n\nThe frozen room does not stop time. It stops one flame's share of it, and watches who walks by."
   ]
  }
